sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant R as Room coordination
    participant P as Pi Session
    participant S as Dispatch receipt store
    R->>P: Dispatch identified task
    P-->>R: Accepted, execution starts
    R--xS: Crash before ACK is persisted
    Note over R,S: Coordination state is unknown
    Note over P: Execution may still be alive
    R->>P: Recover binding and reconcile execution state
    P-->>R: Actual execution state and result
    Note over R,P: Unknown is not stopped; Pi remains execution owner
